*> vybe-test: cobol/value_clauses/test_value_clause_spaces
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_value_clauses.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-STR1 PIC X(5) VALUE SPACE.
01 WS-STR2 PIC X(5) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-OK PIC X VALUE 'N'.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    IF WS-STR1 = SPACES
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-OK
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-OK.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-OK DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "Y"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [Y] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    IF WS-STR2 = SPACES
        DISPLAY 'Y'
    END-IF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING 'Y' DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "Y"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [Y] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

